Some monsters can be pacified without resorting to spells and swords. However, the character must be able to speak the creature's language. '''Dragonish''' is the language [[Daggerfall:Skills|skill]] that allows you to speak to [[Daggerfall:Dragonling|draconic creatures]].

Dragonish's governing attribute is [[Daggerfall:Intelligence|Intelligence]].
{{NewLine}}

==Description==
<onlyinclude>''"Dragon is a language skill checked whenever one attempts to speak with a dragon."'' The skill check occurs when coming within range of a Dragonling. If successful, the creature will be non-hostile (will not attack unless provoked).</onlyinclude>

